&lt;p&gt;The theme sends less on every page and paints its largest element sooner on every page on a simulated phone. When the browser is really throttled to a slow connection, it paints first content 0.4 to 0.6 s later on three of the five pages tested.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;page-weight&quot;&gt;Page weight&lt;a data-heading-anchor=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;#page-weight&quot; aria-label=&quot;Link to this section&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://visruthsk.github.io/website-theme/measure-weight.svg&quot; alt=&quot;Kilobytes sent for each of nine pages, astro-erudite against this theme: the theme sends less on every page, about a fifth as much on the two pages with maths and code&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The two pages with maths and code are the heaviest in both builds, since they also load the code stylesheet and a maths font. The theme sends 87 kB for them against astro-erudite’s 466 kB, and fonts are nearly all of the gap: 71 kB against 442 kB.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;largest-paint&quot;&gt;Largest paint&lt;a data-heading-anchor=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;#largest-paint&quot; aria-label=&quot;Link to this section&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://visruthsk.github.io/website-theme/measure-lcp.svg&quot; alt=&quot;Seconds until the largest element is painted on a simulated phone, nine pages: the theme is faster on every page, most of all on the two pages with maths and code&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Largest paint comes 2.1 s sooner on the two pages with maths and code, 1.05 s sooner on the home page and 0.6 s sooner on the other six. First paint is level or earlier on the theme everywhere except the listing, where astro-erudite is ahead by 0.15 s (0.90 s against 1.05 s).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;lighthouse-scores&quot;&gt;Lighthouse scores&lt;a data-heading-anchor=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;#lighthouse-scores&quot; aria-label=&quot;Link to this section&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Medians of 11 runs per page across the nine pages:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
